       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-HOLO-WAVE.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-HOLO-WAVE-PROOFS.
           05  WS-SLM-PHASE-OK             PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-GERCHBERG-OK             PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SPECKLE-SUPPRESS-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-HOLOGRAM-LATENCY-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-HOLOGRAM-SEAL-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-HOLO-WAVE-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PHW-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PHW-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-SLM-AND-GERCHBERG.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-SPECKLE-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PHW-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-SLM-AND-GERCHBERG.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SLM-PHASE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-GERCHBERG-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-SPECKLE-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SPECKLE-SUPPRESS-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-HOLOGRAM-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PHW-PROOFS.
           IF WS-SLM-PHASE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-GERCHBERG-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SPECKLE-SUPPRESS-OK = 1 AND
              WS-HOLOGRAM-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-HOLOGRAM-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PHW-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PHW-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PHW-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PHW-CODE.
